; An include may climb out of the including file's directory and back
; down again.  The semantic bisimulation reads each journal from a place
; where its neighbours sit as they do in the source tree, so a path like
; this one resolves for the Lean oracle exactly as it does for ledger.

include ../../test/regress/include-glob-escapes/j.dat

test bal
              $-4.00  Assets:Cash
               $4.00  Expenses:Letter
--------------------
                   0
end test
